  "title": "CRH Appoints Aylwyn Bryan as CFO",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – May 13, 2026 – CRH (NYSE: CRH), the leading provider of building materials, announced the appointment of Aylwyn Bryan as its Chief Financial Officer, effective May 12, 2026. Bryan has over 25 years of financial leadership experience, including the past 14 years with CRH. Most recently he served as CFO of CRH’s […]",
